{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mech-ute</i>\u00a0(noun | m\u02c8\u025bk-j\u02c8u\u02d0t | portmanteau word combining \u201cmecha\u201d and \u201ccute\u201d) is a colorful, relaxed-paced, 2D adventure-puzzle game, which can be played by one to two players via couch co-op.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/d6ec91111e14301d37b2aeb1943be0ad.poster.avif?t=1767715673\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/d6ec91111e14301d37b2aeb1943be0ad.webm?t=1767715673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Earth Heals after Devastation Strikes</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of the '90s, a cataclysm marks the end of the world as we know it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over numerous decades of humanity's absence, the Earth slowly recovers as nature finally reclaims its rights.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Embark on an Epic Journey</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this post-apocalyptic world, a solitary young girl stumbles upon an obsolete and defective robot known as a\u00a0<i>Mech-ute</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together, they embark on a journey guided by the sole information still programmed in the Mech-ute's deteriorated system: a set of geographic coordinates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/9b0d6abdf0e1ed339266442e1088656d.poster.avif?t=1767715673\" aria-label=\"A gif showcasing a diverse panel of locations\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/9b0d6abdf0e1ed339266442e1088656d.webm?t=1767715673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/9b0d6abdf0e1ed339266442e1088656d.mp4?t=1767715673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Overcome Obstacles Together</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our duo will have to team up to face various challenges to reach their destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They will brave the elements, explore lush colorful landscapes, uncover relics from the turn of the 21st century and encounter a handful of peculiar individuals along the way. Throughout their quest, our duo's relationship will flourish in this heartfelt story that promotes one of the most precious things of all:\u00a0<strong><i>hope</i></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The remaining question is... what will they discover at the end of their journey?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/c9a0f60a64d1d534eb79624fceb333d9.poster.avif?t=1767715673\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/c9a0f60a64d1d534eb79624fceb333d9.webm?t=1767715673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/c9a0f60a64d1d534eb79624fceb333d9.mp4?t=1767715673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/8b7b61047c4022f95c8f83bf0bb34cf7.avif?t=1767715673\" alt=\"Main features\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras_big/8b7b61047c4022f95c8f83bf0bb34cf7.avif?t=1767715673 width=800 height=106 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging asymmetrical co-op gameplay \u2014</strong> Control two vastly different characters to reach your destination.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A unique hybrid form \u2014</strong> Through the young girl, pilot the Mech-ute to unlock new abilities and create a unique cooperative experience.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special Abilities \u2014</strong> Upgrade your Mech-ute to help you out of any predicament.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Activate your Abilities</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/d57bd5c94e07098372c1a74237ea8a04.poster.avif?t=1767715673\" aria-label=\"A gif showcasing a character&#039;s powers\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/d57bd5c94e07098372c1a74237ea8a04.webm?t=1767715673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/d57bd5c94e07098372c1a74237ea8a04.mp4?t=1767715673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Interact with the Environment</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/edcb29e58852bbf153a242d32abf94ea.poster.avif?t=1767715673\" aria-label=\"A gif showcasing different possible interactions\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/edcb29e58852bbf153a242d32abf94ea.webm?t=1767715673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/edcb29e58852bbf153a242d32abf94ea.mp4?t=1767715673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Collect Lore</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/b3e5861e415eb26a1bab3707fe83e704.poster.avif?t=1767715673\" aria-label=\"A gif showcasing various lore elements to collect\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/b3e5861e415eb26a1bab3707fe83e704.webm?t=1767715673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/b3e5861e415eb26a1bab3707fe83e704.mp4?t=1767715673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Meet Cute Robots</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/b9ea650f9e181f20621489fb834c1e3a.webp?t=1767715673\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/b9ea650f9e181f20621489fb834c1e3a.poster.avif?t=1767715673\" class=\"bb_img\" alt=\"\"width=600 height=200 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/cc34976247817af0dc22dcae887e367d.avif?t=1767715673\" alt=\"About the team\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras_big/cc34976247817af0dc22dcae887e367d.avif?t=1767715673 width=800 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are\u00a0<strong>Tempete Studio,</strong>\u00a0a small independent video game studio located in Poitiers, France. Our goal is to bring joy to people through our games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We previously collaborated with <i>Libellud</i> on <strong><i>Dixit World</i></strong>, the mobile adaptation of\u00a0the popular board game <i>Dixit</i>. Building on this experience, we set out to develop our first original game. We wanted to tell a heartfelt story about a little girl and a big robot centered around hope and friendship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/1aaddbb8e7f49b308f974a62f701cb44.avif?t=1767715673\" alt=\"Wishlist today and follow for updates\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras_big/1aaddbb8e7f49b308f974a62f701cb44.avif?t=1767715673 width=800 height=293 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3846580?t=1767715673","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/29c7c6e6b27b784f5c963352fa2d604b370e49af/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767715673","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/d32667e5362f5aa2055a986c6b1bd3badecf55e0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767715673","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/d32667e5362f5aa2055a986c6b1bd3badecf55e0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767715673","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mech-ute</i>\u00a0(noun | m\u02c8\u025bk-j\u02c8u\u02d0t | portmanteau word combining \u201cmecha\u201d and \u201ccute\u201d) is a colorful, relaxed-paced, 2D adventure-puzzle game, which can be played by one to two players via couch co-op.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/d6ec91111e14301d37b2aeb1943be0ad.poster.avif?t=1767715673\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/d6ec91111e14301d37b2aeb1943be0ad.webm?t=1767715673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Earth Heals after Devastation Strikes</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of the '90s, a cataclysm marks the end of the world as we know it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over numerous decades of humanity's absence, the Earth slowly recovers as nature finally reclaims its rights.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Embark on an Epic Journey</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this post-apocalyptic world, a solitary young girl stumbles upon an obsolete and defective robot known as a\u00a0<i>Mech-ute</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together, they embark on a journey guided by the sole information still programmed in the Mech-ute's deteriorated system: a set of geographic coordinates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/9b0d6abdf0e1ed339266442e1088656d.poster.avif?t=1767715673\" aria-label=\"A gif showcasing a diverse panel of locations\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/9b0d6abdf0e1ed339266442e1088656d.webm?t=1767715673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/9b0d6abdf0e1ed339266442e1088656d.mp4?t=1767715673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Overcome Obstacles Together</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our duo will have to team up to face various challenges to reach their destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They will brave the elements, explore lush colorful landscapes, uncover relics from the turn of the 21st century and encounter a handful of peculiar individuals along the way. Throughout their quest, our duo's relationship will flourish in this heartfelt story that promotes one of the most precious things of all:\u00a0<strong><i>hope</i></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The remaining question is... what will they discover at the end of their journey?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/c9a0f60a64d1d534eb79624fceb333d9.poster.avif?t=1767715673\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/c9a0f60a64d1d534eb79624fceb333d9.webm?t=1767715673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/c9a0f60a64d1d534eb79624fceb333d9.mp4?t=1767715673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/8b7b61047c4022f95c8f83bf0bb34cf7.avif?t=1767715673\" alt=\"Main features\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras_big/8b7b61047c4022f95c8f83bf0bb34cf7.avif?t=1767715673 width=800 height=106 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging asymmetrical co-op gameplay \u2014</strong> Control two vastly different characters to reach your destination.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A unique hybrid form \u2014</strong> Through the young girl, pilot the Mech-ute to unlock new abilities and create a unique cooperative experience.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special Abilities \u2014</strong> Upgrade your Mech-ute to help you out of any predicament.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Activate your Abilities</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/d57bd5c94e07098372c1a74237ea8a04.poster.avif?t=1767715673\" aria-label=\"A gif showcasing a character&#039;s powers\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/d57bd5c94e07098372c1a74237ea8a04.webm?t=1767715673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/d57bd5c94e07098372c1a74237ea8a04.mp4?t=1767715673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Interact with the Environment</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/ste